<title>USA: UROHEALTH gets clearance for video system.</title>
<headline>UROHEALTH gets clearance for video system.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT BEACH, Calif 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>UROHEALTH Systems Inc said it received clearance from the U.S. Food and Drug Administration to market its integrated video system, the EVII.</p>
<p>The integrated video system joins EndoView as the second in the UROHEALTH visualization product portfolio of highly differentiated, portable and affordable endoscopic video systems.</p>
</text>
